.Dd November 17, 2026
.Dt LOGGER 1
.Os RavenBSD
.Sh NAME
.Nm logger
.Nd write a record to the system log
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Fl p Ar priority
.Op Fl t Ar tag
.Op Fl f Ar file
.Op Ar message ...
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
opens
.Pa log:<tag>
and writes
.Dq Li <priority> Ns Ar message
to the
.Nm logd
ring.
The default priority is
.Ql user.notice
and the default tag is
.Ql logger .
.Pp
The priority is a number, a
.Ql facility.severity
pair, a severity, or a facility.
Supported facilities are
.Ql kern , user , mail , daemon , auth , syslog , lpr , news , uucp , cron ,
.Ql authpriv , ftp
and
.Ql local0
through
.Ql local7 ;
severities are
.Ql emerg , alert , crit , err , warning , notice , info
and
.Ql debug .
.Sh OPTIONS
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Fl p Ar priority
Select the syslog priority.
.It Fl t Ar tag
Select the log name.
.It Fl f Ar file
Log the file contents instead of the message operands.
.El
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Ex -std
A read/write or usage error exits non-zero.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr dmesg 1 ,
.Xr syslog 3
.Sh STANDARDS
IEEE Std 1003.1-2024
.Pq POSIX.1-2024 .
